Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.10,0:00:22.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berpura-puralah tidak tahu, Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak berniat kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.27,0:00:27.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau melakukan ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.36,0:00:28.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.07,0:00:31.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,dipanggil ke Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.53,0:00:36.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.16,0:00:39.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tidak membutuhkanmu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini terlalu keras!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.96,0:00:46.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.26,0:00:54.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.18,0:00:56.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia menggunakan serangan Air.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.05,0:00:58.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang aku mengerti\Nkenapa mereka belum kembali.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penyihir Tanah?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu Natsuno?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.11,0:01:16.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.34,0:01:34.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seseorang sepertimu
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.05,0:01:38.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak berhak memanggil Masago\Ndengan namanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.85,0:01:44.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.60,0:01:47.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka... Natsuno...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.52,0:01:53.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat ini...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.69,0:01:57.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pada malam saat Nona Sana mati,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melihat energi jahat yang sama\Ndi kediaman itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.49,0:02:02.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.70,0:02:05.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat yang sama, dari 900 tahun lalu,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.91,0:02:06.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,saat Nona Sana mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.38,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.01,0:02:20.84,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Berhenti!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.93,0:02:21.93,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Nanoka...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.10,0:02:24.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buka matamu!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.31,0:02:26.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.98,0:02:28.73,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Itu berasal darinya!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.60,0:02:31.61,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.69,0:02:33.77,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya dia memihak Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.69,0:02:37.40,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Tapi tidak sepertimu, Mao,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:38.49,0:02:40.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku tak punya alasan untuk menahan diri!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.51,0:03:01.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.05,0:03:03.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.39,0:03:07.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.93,0:03:09.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.87,0:03:30.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.38,0:03:37.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berandal itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau takkan lolos, Shiranui.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.23,0:03:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.19,0:03:57.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.79,0:04:10.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.26,0:04:23.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.38,0:04:25.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka, kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.14,0:04:28.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.35,0:04:31.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tampak baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.92,0:06:18.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.79,0:06:23.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shiranui berengsek itu
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.17,0:06:25.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,mengambil jasad Masago.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu berarti
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.51,0:06:32.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,dia benar-benar mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.35,0:06:36.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa dia masih terlihat sangat cantik?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.02,0:06:41.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin untuk alasan yang sama,\Nkami masih hidup usai dipanggil ke Goshikido.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.02,0:06:44.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mayat yang tidak membusuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.03,0:06:47.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu artinya Masago
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.28,0:06:52.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,masih belum lolos dari takdir Goshikido\Nbahkan setelah mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu memuakkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.50,0:07:00.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kamon,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.09,0:07:06.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku akan merebut Masago.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.63,0:07:09.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Walau itu tubuhnya yang tak bernyawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku penasaran bagaimana perasaan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melihatnya seperti itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia masih mencintai Nona Sana?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.65,0:07:29.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.61,0:07:33.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.91,0:07:36.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoya, kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.45,0:07:41.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kabur bersama Nona Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.75,0:07:44.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak, Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.84,0:07:47.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, jangan sungkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.67,0:07:52.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sudah kerepotan dengan Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.93,0:07:56.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku, Otoya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.89,0:07:59.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir, Nona Nanoka,\Naku senang kau baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.43,0:08:03.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao, wanita yang memancarkan\Nenergi jahat itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.65,0:08:08.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.24,0:08:11.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah kau bilang
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.65,0:08:15.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau melihat energi jahat yang sama\Npada malam saat Nona Sana mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.41,0:08:19.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan hanya itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu mencabut jantung Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jantungnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.63,0:08:31.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao mengkhianati kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.05,0:08:35.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Mao membunuh Guru kita!\N- Temukan dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.93,0:08:37.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rumah Perbendaharaan terbakar!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.39,0:08:41.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari itu, para pria di kediaman itu
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.39,0:08:44.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,terbagi antara mereka yang mengejar Mao
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.69,0:08:47.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan yang terlalu sibuk berusaha\Nmemadamkan api Rumah Perbendaharaan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.28,0:08:58.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hanya aku yang melihat Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.75,0:09:02.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.46,0:09:07.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.84,0:09:15.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, Nona Sana masih hidup?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.14,0:09:18.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.60,0:09:20.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu bukan karena hujan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.72,0:09:22.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada jejak air mata.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.06,0:09:25.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.60,0:09:27.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao belum melakukan apa pun.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.69,0:09:32.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.99,0:09:37.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana tahu aku tak bersalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.83,0:09:42.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,menghentikan semua orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.67,0:09:48.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana! Kau tak boleh pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.04,0:09:52.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau harus tinggal di tempat yang aman,\NNona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.30,0:10:00.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memberitahunya\Nsemua orang di kediaman sedang haus darah
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan berhasil mencegahnya pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.14,0:10:05.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.18,0:10:08.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,seharusnya aku tetap bersamanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.06,0:10:11.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku merasakan energi jahat yang mengerikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.27,0:10:14.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat aku berbalik, dia sudah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.99,0:10:18.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.41,0:10:28.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu terjadi dalam sekejap.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.54,0:10:31.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Darah menyembur dari dada Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di dalam energi jahat hitam\Nyang meninggalkan tubuhnya,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.77,0:10:51.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku melihat jantung merah darah Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.53,0:10:55.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah itu
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.03,0:10:58.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,energi jahat
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.28,0:11:02.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang sama dari Yurako tadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.12,0:11:04.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia sangat mirip
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.04,0:11:13.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Sana mati
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,tepat di depan mataku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.30,0:11:22.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau merahasiakannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.97,0:11:26.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua orang di kediaman itu yakin
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao membunuh Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga melihatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.52,0:11:34.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao mengkhianati Klan Goko.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.77,0:11:37.28,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Dia musuh bebuyutan kita!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.78,0:11:38.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu yang terus dikatakan Hakubi\Nkepada semua orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah kenapa.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memberi tahu semua orang\Napa yang kulihat,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.16,0:11:52.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi tidak ada yang memercayaiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.17,0:11:56.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hakubi dipercaya\Noleh semua orang di kediaman itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.63,0:12:01.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan itu setelah Mao berubah dan mengamuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.26,0:12:05.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimanapun,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.22,0:12:08.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Klan Goko runtuh setelah itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.10,0:12:13.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, tidak ada yang ingin tahu\Nkebenarannya lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.02,0:12:16.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.23,0:12:19.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan pergi sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika kau tahu sesuatu\Ntentang wanita itu, Yurako,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,beri tahu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.29,0:12:39.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Natsuno juga penasaran tentang Yurako.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya sangat jelas sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako bukan Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.47,0:12:48.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.93,0:12:51.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,tak membunuh Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.68,0:13:01.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga, sungguh mengejutkan, Tuan Kuchinawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.65,0:13:04.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian semua kembali basah kuyup.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.07,0:13:08.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kimonoku akan cocok\Nsebagai pakaian ganti Nona Nanoka?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau sangat perhatian, Nona.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.83,0:13:15.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.17,0:13:18.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku merasa hidup lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.46,0:13:21.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski belum ada yang benar-benar beres.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.51,0:13:27.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf membuatmu menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.89,0:13:32.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tampak menawan, Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.31,0:13:34.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.10,0:13:38.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoya selalu cepat memujiku,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.77,0:13:40.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dia bahkan tak mau melihatku.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.44,0:13:45.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau harus meminjam kimono itu\Nkarena kita akan pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa Kamon ingin sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.87,0:13:52.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.91,0:13:56.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua ini pasti mengejutkan bagi Kamon.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.13,0:13:59.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masago!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.42,0:14:04.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau masih akan mengejar Yurako?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.47,0:14:11.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Energi jahat hitam itu\Nmengambil jantung Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yurako diselimuti energi jahat yang sama
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.35,0:14:16.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan dia memiliki wajah Nona Sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.73,0:14:20.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa dia sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kutukan...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.11,0:14:28.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Byoki itu bilang itu mungkin
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.36,0:14:30.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,kutukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.16,0:14:37.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya Nona Sana\Njuga memuntahkan energi jahat hitam.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.58,0:14:38.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.29,0:14:40.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bertemu Byoki itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.71,0:14:44.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.71,0:14:46.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tak memberitahuku?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.97,0:14:49.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kukira mendengar hal seperti itu\Ntentang Nona Sana
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,hanya akan membuatmu kesal.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.68,0:14:54.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selain itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau selalu tampak sangat sibuk.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.98,0:14:57.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.52,0:15:00.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Byoki itu mengincarmu
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.31,0:15:01.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,sebagai wadahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sangat mencemaskanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.82,0:15:07.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau tak bisa mengerti itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.45,0:15:09.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.57,0:15:13.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah berusaha memikirkan perasaanmu,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.16,0:15:18.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi kau tidak pernah memperhatikanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.41,0:15:21.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau hanya memedulikan wanita\Ndari masa lalu itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.33,0:15:23.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.80,0:15:25.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.46,0:15:28.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian masih di sini?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.55,0:15:30.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami baru mau pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ugh... Mmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.01,0:15:37.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu canggung!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.10,0:15:40.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak mengatakan sepatah kata pun
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.48,0:15:43.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,sepanjang perjalanan pulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah apa Mao marah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.58,0:15:57.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin dia membenciku sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.41,0:16:01.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.71,0:16:05.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana aku bisa berbaikan dengannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.55,0:16:14.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah melipat kimono\Nyang kau pinjam di era Taisho.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.89,0:16:15.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Uozumi.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.56,0:16:17.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum datang ke sini,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau sudah lama menjadi shikigami Mao, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.10,0:16:21.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.02,0:16:23.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang disukai Mao?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.10,0:16:25.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makanan atau hobi favoritnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesuatu yang akan dia nikmati sebagai hadiah
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang akan menghiburnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.95,0:16:33.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.41,0:16:34.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.99,0:16:38.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku katashiro\Nyang tetap ada di dalam tasnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.45,0:16:42.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahkan saat ini,\Ntubuh asliku masih ada di era Taisho.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.96,0:16:54.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu apa pun\Ntentang kehidupan pribadi Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.72,0:16:58.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melihatnya masih terasa canggung.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.19,0:17:04.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.94,0:17:06.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.98,0:17:09.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kimono yang kupinjam.\NKutitipkan ini kepadamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.82,0:17:10.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau akan segera pergi?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.49,0:17:13.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Aku tak bisa di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.99,0:17:14.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.37,0:17:18.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang kembali, Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.74,0:17:21.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau sibuk?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.41,0:17:25.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.00,0:17:27.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.71,0:17:29.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,bantu aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.42,0:17:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah. Bisakah kau mengurus ini, Otoya?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.63,0:17:34.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu, Nona Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga harimu menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.19,0:17:49.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.40,0:17:51.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau butuh bantuanku untuk apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.94,0:17:54.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku diminta melakukan pengusiran setan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.49,0:17:57.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, jadi
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.45,0:18:00.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku hanya perlu memegang tabung bambu ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.95,0:18:01.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.84,0:18:13.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah hilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.51,0:18:16.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menyelamatkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.43,0:18:18.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.18,0:18:20.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini luar biasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.14,0:18:22.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah selesai?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa bantuanku diperlukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.74,0:18:36.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.36,0:18:38.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.74,0:18:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,suka makanan Barat?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.91,0:18:46.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.41,0:18:49.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku selalu ingin mencoba
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.33,0:18:50.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,makanan Barat dari zaman ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitukah? Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat makan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.10,0:19:06.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak tahu kau suka makanan Barat, Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.60,0:19:07.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begini...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.77,0:19:11.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku selalu ingin mencobanya,\Ntapi tidak pernah sempat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.02,0:19:13.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, ini kali pertamamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.69,0:19:15.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini kali pertamaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.53,0:19:20.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enak?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.16,0:19:22.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku belum mencicipinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.41,0:19:24.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.08,0:19:27.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otoya adalah shikigami,\Njadi dia bahkan tidak makan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.96,0:19:31.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah apa dia merasa canggung\Ndatang ke tempat seperti ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.05,0:19:36.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lezat!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Enak, bukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.72,0:19:41.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, ini lezat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.64,0:19:43.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.30,0:19:46.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Beberapa area sudah dibangun ulang.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.77,0:19:48.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.10,0:19:51.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,biarkan aku membalas bantuanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.10,0:19:53.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan membelikanmu sesuatu yang kau suka.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.86,0:19:56.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa? Sungguh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.69,0:19:58.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sesekali saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.82,0:20:01.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa dengannya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.99,0:20:04.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia belum pernah melakukan ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.70,0:20:08.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, apa dia
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.95,0:20:11.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,berusaha menebus kesalahannya kepadaku?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.88,0:20:21.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kantong parfum ini menggemaskan sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.59,0:20:23.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau suka benda-benda menggemaskan, Nanoka?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.39,0:20:25.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.97,0:20:26.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.10,0:20:29.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik, Pak. Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.81,0:20:31.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.44,0:20:34.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sama-sama. Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mengerti sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.61,0:20:46.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tak pernah memperhatikanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.79,0:20:50.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia pasti memikirkan ucapanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku penasaran apa Nona Sana
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.46,0:20:57.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,adalah cinta pertama Mao?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.25,0:21:02.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia mati dengan cara yang mengerikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.18,0:21:06.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu Yurako yang mirip dengannya muncul.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.10,0:21:10.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jadi, mustahil untuk tidak memikirkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.89,0:21:15.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu itu, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.36,0:21:23.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh... Apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.90,0:21:24.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.57,0:21:27.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu... Tidak mungkin...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.08,0:21:30.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kehilangan dia!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.75,0:21:33.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga... Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.92,0:21:39.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.00,0:21:41.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.80,0:21:48.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mao!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.89,0:21:50.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanoka!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.40,0:21:59.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mengagetkanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.19,0:22:02.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau membuatku khawatir karena menghilang.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.86,0:22:07.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya kau bisa
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.74,0:22:09.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,menoleh ke belakang\Nuntuk melihat apa aku ada di sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.41,0:22:12.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah masalahmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.17,0:22:17.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.43,0:22:27.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.35,0:22:35.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tahu...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.35,0:22:37.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benci mengakuinya, tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:44.11,0:22:45.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kurasa aku menyukainya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:52.58,0:22:53.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Mao.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.91,0:22:56.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa suasana hati Nona Nanoka\Nsudah lebih baik?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.96,0:22:58.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Kurasa begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.04,0:23:02.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bersenang-senang, Tuan Mao?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.01,0:23:06.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu sangat menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:11.55,0:23:13.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sulit sekali mengetahui\Nperasaannya yang sebenarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.07,0:24:50.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini mengerikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.57,0:24:52.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tubuhnya tercabik-cabik.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.53,0:24:55.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa itu sungguh perbuatan manusia?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.62,0:24:57.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakak.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:57.87,0:25:01.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:01.33,0:25:04.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita tidak akan tahu kecuali aku mencobanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:04.25,0:25:08.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia terkait dengan Klan Goko?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.67,0:25:10.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inikah yang kau cari?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.67,0:25:14.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Monster itu masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.18,0:25:17.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya, "Soma".
